    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Spell Rift&quot;</strong>\u00a0is a turn-based tactical game with a unique combat system where your enemies are as dangerous and skilled as you are. Create powerful spell combinations, use accumulated charges, and defeat various enemies in semi-automatic battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every turn is a tactical decision! Choose your attack position, combine spells, and use terrain features. But be careful - each monster has its own set of abilities and can use the same mechanics as you: accumulate charges, combine spells, and create unexpected tactical situations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022</strong> Unique semi-automatic combat system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022\u00a0Turn-based gameplay with deep tactical elements</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 Charge and spell system identical for both hero and enemies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022</strong> Smart enemies with their own ability sets and tactics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022</strong> Each monster has its own spell set and can create combinations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022</strong> Ability to create your own spell combinations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022</strong> Hero progression through new spells and items</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Spell Rift&quot;</strong>\u00a0is a turn-based tactical game with a unique combat system where your enemies are as dangerous and skilled as you are. Create powerful spell combinations, use accumulated charges, and defeat various enemies in semi-automatic battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every turn is a tactical decision! Choose your attack position, combine spells, and use terrain features. But be careful - each monster has its own set of abilities and can use the same mechanics as you: accumulate charges, combine spells, and create unexpected tactical situations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022</strong> Unique semi-automatic combat system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022\u00a0Turn-based gameplay with deep tactical elements</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 Charge and spell system identical for both hero and enemies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022</strong> Smart enemies with their own ability sets and tactics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022</strong> Each monster has its own spell set and can create combinations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022</strong> Ability to create your own spell combinations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022</strong> Hero progression through new spells and items</p>",
